# Per-app ignores live in backend/.gitignore and frontend/.gitignore.
# This file covers the repo root only.

# secrets — the real deploy env never leaves the server.
# .env.production.example is covered by the wildcard on purpose: there is
# no negation for *.example, because the example file is filled in with
# real values while working and a negation invites committing them.
.env
.env.*

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# Session plan documents. Working notes, not part of the software: nothing
# builds, deploys or renders from them, and they accumulate whatever was
# pasted while working — plan-2026-09-05-1218.md carried a real admin
# password to origin/main for twelve days before anyone noticed. The
# design rulebook (AGENTS.md), the deploy runbook and the READMEs stay
# tracked; a clone needs those to build and ship.
plan.md
plan-*.md
